Task 7:
///Lab: Username enumeration via account lock///

Open the site in burp, make a fake login and send the request to intruder. Select Cluster bomb attack, add 2 payload positions. The first is the username value, the second is after (!!) the password value, an empty 
payload position. Add the username database to the first payload, and at the 2nd payload position select 'Null payloads'. Under this in the payload configuration set the Generate payloads to 5. Run the attack.
There will be one with a different length. That is your valid username. Change the intruders payload to sniper attack, change the username value to the valid, put a payload position to the password value, copy 
the password database into the payload configuration, and run the attack, then Log in.


